Flow: A shared, responsive feedlot operations workspace for one user population. The persistent menu takes users from live lot and pen performance through cattle imports, inventory, rations, feeding and weights, then to reports and a project/demo area. Dense, filterable operational tables carry the marketplace field’s scannable catalog pattern into feedlot records without turning the product into a storefront; costs are easy to compare, and real crop or cattle photographs appear only where they help identify the item or animals.

